# 广告 / 追踪 SDK 拦截规则 —— ACL4SSR BanAD / BanProgramAD 补充
# 收录 ACL4SSR 尚未覆盖的广告聚合 / 追踪 SDK 域名，统一拒绝
# 仓库: https://github.com/DuskWander87/shadowrocket-config
# 更新: 手动维护，新增域名请先通过 domain-verify skill 确认归属

# TopOn / AnyThink 广告聚合 SDK (广州, 中国区现为 Taku, anythinktech.com)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anythinktech.com

# 联想营销/分析子域 (lenovo.com 主域走 ChinaDirect 直连, 此处仅拦其营销子域)
# 本节优先级高于 ChinaDirect.list, 拦截先于直连生效
# 功能域 download / support / pcsupport.lenovo.com 不在此列, 不受影响
# Oracle Eloqua 营销自动化 (CNAME -> now.eloqua.com / elqcdn.eloqua.com -> en25.com)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,app.update.lenovo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,forms.lenovo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,forms-emea.lenovo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,images.business.lenovo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,images.smbdirect.lenovo.com
# Adobe Analytics 埋点 (CNAME -> *.sc.omtrdc.net, first-party 采集域规避第三方 Cookie 限制)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,o.lenovo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,s.lenovo.com
# 营销邮件点击追踪 (Azure China / 上海蓝云 AS58593)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,click.lenovo.com
